<title>AUSTRALIA: L.Lease, IBM to formalise j/v with Telstra.</title>
<headline>L.Lease, IBM to formalise j/v with Telstra.</headline>
<dateline>SYDNEY 1997-05-28</dateline>
<text>
<p>Property and financial services Lend Lease Corp Ltd said on Wednesday that negotiations are been finalised for the state-owend Telstra Corp  to join the ISSC Australia joint venture it formed with International Business Machines in October 1994.</p>
</text>
